      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like i'm just waiting for something that's never coming back. like, why am i even fighting to stay in a world that feels this hollow? even people tell me \"it's just a dog\" or \"it'll get easier\" but it doesn't. it just stays this empty. sometimes i look at my life and i just don't see the logic in continuing this cycle of just... being lonely. it feels like a loop that doesn't have a purpose anymore.",
